    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to travel through dangerous levels where countless threats await you! Each level is a maze of paths, and you'll have to move carefully, step by step, dodging traps and solving puzzles.: Fight enemies face to face or avoid them. What is your main goal? Complete each level without loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the fight for survival, weapons are your key ally. Find it and use it wisely, but remember: any weapon has limited durability. Keep an eye on the condition of your equipment \u2014 a worn-out blade can break in the midst of a battle. Shields are also vital for protection, fending off enemy attacks. Look for power-ups to restore the strength of shields and weapons, because without them, your defense can fail at a critical moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will chase you relentlessly, and everyone has their own abilities and tactics. While they're hunting you, remember: the best strategy is cunning and quick decisions. Skillful maneuvers will help you outplay even the strongest opponents. If a collision can be avoided, consider running away. Sometimes that's what will save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting challenge where every step can be your last. Be careful, act wisely, and you may be able to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to travel through dangerous levels where countless threats await you! Each level is a maze of paths, and you'll have to move carefully, step by step, dodging traps and solving puzzles.: Fight enemies face to face or avoid them. What is your main goal? Complete each level without loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the fight for survival, weapons are your key ally. Find it and use it wisely, but remember: any weapon has limited durability. Keep an eye on the condition of your equipment \u2014 a worn-out blade can break in the midst of a battle. Shields are also vital for protection, fending off enemy attacks. Look for power-ups to restore the strength of shields and weapons, because without them, your defense can fail at a critical moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will chase you relentlessly, and everyone has their own abilities and tactics. While they're hunting you, remember: the best strategy is cunning and quick decisions. Skillful maneuvers will help you outplay even the strongest opponents. If a collision can be avoided, consider running away. Sometimes that's what will save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an exciting challenge where every step can be your last. Be careful, act wisely, and you may be able to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
